/v1/","context":{"app_id":4744400,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4744400","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:46:58Z","value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4790190","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4744400-1846651706692620","game_id":"steam-4744400","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest Is Here!","summary":"Hello everyone! The Developer of Verdant Requiem, here.Steam Next Fest has begun, and Verdant Requiem is taking part!Verdant Requiem is a story-driven tactical RPG set in a war-torn fantasy world where salt and iron shape the fate of nations. Lead your allies through turn-based battles, manage the resources that keep your army going, and get to know the companions fighting by your side.The demo was updated on October 19 and lets you play through the end of Chapter 9!Whether you love deep tactica","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:21:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692620","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4744400-1846018067939452","game_id":"steam-4744400","kind":"announcement","title":"Verdant Requiem Closed Beta Has Ended","summary":"The closed beta test for Verdant Requiem has now concluded.Thank you very much to everyone who participated.Players tested each of the game’s routes and provided a great deal of feedback on game balance, the UI, controls, and various systems.We are currently incorporating that feedback while making the final adjustments ahead of the game’s release on November 3.Polishing Battle Presentation Until the Very EndAlongside system and balance adjustments, we are also continuing to refine the game’s ba","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T21:42:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4744400-1842846814450399","game_id":"steam-4744400","kind":"update","title":"Verdant Requiem Development Update","summary":"Verdant Requiem Development Update — Final Adjustments Based on Closed Beta FeedbackHello.Verdant Requiem is currently undergoing final adjustments ahead of release.Recently, we have continued running a closed beta test, making balance adjustments, improving usability, and fixing bugs based on feedback from our testers.Some testers have already completed each of the game's routes, and we are very grateful to have received positive feedback on the game as a whole.As this is a project that has bee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T08:36:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814450399","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4744400-1835871199299580","game_id":"steam-4744400","kind":"update","title":"English Localization Progress Update","summary":"Thank you for your interest in Verdant Requiem.We are currently working on the English localization of the game.Most non-story text, including system text, UI, help messages, and various descriptions, has now been translated.In addition, approximately 30% of the main scenario text has also been translated.Verdant Requiem is a long-form tactical RPG that depicts a resource war between three nations, and the story contains a large amount of text.Because of this, localization is taking some time, b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-17T05:25:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199299580","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4744400-1834602721195403","game_id":"steam-4744400","kind":"announcement","title":"『Verdant Requiem』Final Preparations for Release and English Localization","summary":"Thank you, as always, for your interest in *Verdant Requiem*.We are pleased to announce that the full version of *Verdant Requiem* is now complete.The game can now be played through to the conclusion of its story. As we prepare for release, we are continuing with the final round of polish, including minor bug fixes, game balance adjustments, and improvements to the user interface.Making the Game Even More Enjoyable Ahead of Release*Verdant Requiem* is a strategy RPG depicting a resource war invo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-07T07:16:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721195403","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4744400-1833968530896480","game_id":"steam-4744400","kind":"update","title":"Title: Verdant Requiem Demo and Development Update","summary":"Thank you for your interest in Verdant Requiem.The Steam demo is currently under review in preparation for release. We apologize to everyone who has been waiting for the demo and regret that we are not yet able to make it available.Although this is not directly related to the Steam version, we have also submitted a standalone PC demo to the freeware game distribution site Freem! in order to introduce the game to a wider audience. This version is currently under review as well.Please note that co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-01T04:50:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530896480","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4744400-1833968530886962","game_id":"steam-4744400","kind":"update","title":"BOOTH Demo Update Plans and Steam Release Preparation","summary":"Thank you for your interest in *Verdant Requiem*. We are currently proceeding with the build review process and final checks in preparation for the Steam release. For the Steam version, we are conducting final checks, including achievements and various Steam-related settings. Once the release date has been confirmed, we will make another announcement. We would greatly appreciate your patience while we complete these final steps. In parallel with the Steam release preparations, we also plan to co","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T02:41:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530886962","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:42:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4744400-1833968530884015","game_id":"steam-4744400","kind":"announcement","title":"Verdant Requiem Steam Store Page Is Now Live","summary":"The Steam store page for Verdant Requiem is now live.Verdant Requiem is a long-form, story-driven tactical RPG set on the continent of Gleria, where the ambitions and ideals of three nations intertwine.Players will not only fight to win battles, but also face the challenges of managing supplies and maintaining the balance between nations. The game features original systems such as “Military Logistics,” which involves resources such as food, salt, and minerals, as well as “Faction Balance,” which","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T23:36:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_u